#!/usr/bin/env bash

set -euo pipefail

cat <<'INSTRUCTIONS'

Implement the request and commit.

Run 3 distinct read-only adversarial reviews to temp files:
`h-review-3 'prompt 1' 'prompt 2' 'prompt 3'`
Read/delete all reports; judge feedback, do not apply it blindly.

Substantive = bugs, behavior, security, data integrity, compatibility, material performance,
failing tests, or acceptance criteria. Comments/docs, style, naming, formatting, optional
refactors, and behavior-neutral cleanup are nitpicks. If all findings are minor, make no
changes; rebase `main`, then run `notify-done-sound` and stop if it is a no-op (no conflicts).

If any substantive finding exists, including in a mixed review, or rebase fails, run
`h-feedback <PROMPT ON WHAT TO DO>`; delegate the fix instead of making it in this session.
INSTRUCTIONS
